# Only track source files — ignore everything else (data, checkpoints, venv, runs).
/*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!requirements.txt
!decore/
!configs/
!notebooks/
!demo/

# within tracked dirs, still ignore caches
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# (For reference, the ignored artifacts include:)
#   .venv/                     virtual environment
#   data/                      CIFAR-10 dataset
#   *.pth                      model / agent checkpoints
#   2106.06091v2.pdf           the paper
#   __pycache__/ .ipynb_checkpoints/  caches
